<!-- TRAVEL -->
<section id="gr-travel" class="gr-section">
  <h2 class="gr-h2">Getting There &amp; Around</h2>
  <div class="gr-grid">
    <div class="gr-body">
      <div class="gr-city-feature">
        <div class="gr-img gr-city-image" role="img" aria-label="Athens city view at sunset" style="--gr-city-image:url('https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/The_Acropolis_at_sunset_from_Mount_Lycabettus_on_December_21,_2019.jpg?width=900')"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="gr-card gr-card--city-intro">
        <h3 class="gr-h3">Getting In</h3>
        <p class="gr-p">Fly into <strong>Athens International Airport (ATH)</strong>. Taxi (~&euro;40 flat rate, ~40 min), metro Line 3 to <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Syntagma+Square+Athens" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Syntagma Square</a> (~40 min), or private transfer. If you&rsquo;re heading straight to an island, many have direct international flights &mdash; worth checking before defaulting to ATH.</p>
        <div class="gr-chips">
          <span class="gr-chip">&#x1F695; Taxi ~&euro;40</span>
          <span class="gr-chip">&#x1F687; Metro ~40 min</span>
          <span class="gr-chip">&#x1F4F1; Uber / FreeNow</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="gr-h3">Getting Around</h3>
        <p class="gr-p">Athens is very walkable in the center. <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://free-now.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>FreeNow</strong></a> has the best local driver availability. The metro is clean, cheap, and efficient. Google Maps works great for transit.</p>
        <h3 class="gr-h3">Where to Stay</h3>
        <p class="gr-p">We recommend <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Plaka+Athens" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>Plaka</strong></a> (charming village feel, narrow streets) and <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Thiseio+Athens" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>Thiseio</strong></a> (laid-back, beautiful Acropolis views from the promenade). Both are centrally located.</p>
        <div class="gr-chips gr-chips--flush">
          <a class="gr-chip" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Plaka+Athens" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">&#x1F4CD; Plaka</a>
          <a class="gr-chip" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Thiseio+Athens" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">&#x1F4CD; Thiseio</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <aside class="gr-aside">
      <div class="gr-tip gr-tip--facts">
        <div class="gr-tip-title">&#x1F6EC; Quick Facts</div>
        <dl class="gr-fact-list">
          <div><dt>Airport</dt><dd>ATH &mdash; Eleftherios Venizelos</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Metro to centre</dt><dd>~40 min</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Taxi flat rate</dt><dd>~&euro;40</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Currency</dt><dd>Euro (&euro;)</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Language</dt><dd>Greek</dd></div>
          <div><dt>SIM cards</dt><dd>At airport arrivals</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </div>
      <div class="gr-tip gr-tip--tips">
        <div class="gr-tip-title">&#x1F4A1; Pro Tips</div>
        <ul class="gr-tip-list">
          <li>Validate your metro ticket before boarding</li>
          <li>FreeNow usually beats Uber on price &amp; availability</li>
          <li>Hotels in <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Plaka+Athens" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Plaka</a> are walkable to almost everything</li>
          <li>Most restaurants open for dinner at 8&ndash;9 PM</li>
          <li>Book island ferries at <a href="https://ferryscanner.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ferryscanner.com</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SIGHTS -->
<section id="gr-sights" class="gr-section">
  <h2 class="gr-h2">Things to Do in Athens</h2>
  <div class="gr-grid">
    <div class="gr-body">
      <div class="gr-img" style="aspect-ratio:16/9">
        <img src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/The_Acropolis_of_Athens_on_January_30,_2022.jpg?width=900" alt="The Acropolis of Athens" loading="lazy">
      </div>
      <p class="gr-tagline">Ancient history and modern energy sit right on top of each other.</p>
      <div class="gr-card gr-card--flush">
        <div class="gr-sight gr-sight--ticketed">
          <div class="gr-sight-name">Acropolis</div>
          <div class="gr-sight-desc">The must-see. Go early to beat crowds and heat. Parthenon, Erechtheion, and Temple of Athena Nike.</div>
          <div class="gr-sight-actions">
            <a class="gr-sight-action gr-sight-action--map" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Acropolis+of+Athens" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="gr-sight-action-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#x1F4CD;</span>Map</a>
            <a class="gr-sight-action gr-sight-action--ticket" href="https://hhticket.gr/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="gr-sight-action-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#x1F39F;&#xFE0F;</span>Official tickets</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a class="gr-sight" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Acropolis+Museum+Athens" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <div class="gr-sight-name">Acropolis Museum <span class="gr-venue-ext">&#x2197;</span></div>
          <div class="gr-sight-desc">World-class collection at the base of the hill. Top-floor gallery with Parthenon views is unforgettable.</div>
        </a>
        <a class="gr-sight" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=National+Garden+Athens" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <div class="gr-sight-name">National Garden <span class="gr-venue-ext">&#x2197;</span></div>
          <div class="gr-sight-desc">Leafy escape next to the Parliament building. Great for a break from the sun.</div>
        </a>
        <a class="gr-sight" href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/Areopagus+Hill/@37.9722409,23.7231843,95m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m6!3m5!1s0x14a1bd1972fd320f:0x673dac60a01f1e34!8m2!3d37.9723655!4d23.7232322!16s%2Fg%2F11b66gtt3z!5m1!1e1?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI1MDYxNy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <div class="gr-sight-name">Vrachakia <span class="gr-venue-ext">&#x2197;</span></div>
          <div class="gr-sight-desc">Lesser-known rocky area with a local feel. Worth exploring off the beaten path.</div>
        </a>
        <a class="gr-sight" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Philopappos+Monument+Athens" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <div class="gr-sight-name">Philopappos Monument <span class="gr-venue-ext">&#x2197;</span></div>
          <div class="gr-sight-desc">Best panoramic views of the Acropolis and city. Especially beautiful at sunset.</div>
        </a>
        <a class="gr-sight" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Odeon+of+Herodes+Atticus+Athens" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <div class="gr-sight-name">Odeon of Herodes Atticus <span class="gr-venue-ext">&#x2197;</span></div>
          <div class="gr-sight-desc">Ancient Roman theatre built into the Acropolis slope, still used for summer performances. Catch a concert or show if the season lines up — it's unforgettable.</div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <aside class="gr-aside">
      <div class="gr-tip gr-tip--itinerary">
        <div class="gr-tip-title">&#x1F5D3; Suggested Order</div>
        <div class="gr-day-plan">
          <div>
            <span class="gr-day-label">Day 1</span>
            <ul class="gr-tip-list">
              <li><a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Acropolis+of+Athens" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Acropolis</a> &mdash; early morning</li>
              <li><a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Acropolis+Museum+Athens" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Acropolis Museum</a></li>
              <li><a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Plaka+Athens" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Plaka</a> stroll &amp; dinner with a view</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="gr-day-label">Day 2</span>
            <ul class="gr-tip-list">
              <li><a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=National+Garden+Athens" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">National Garden</a> &amp; <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Hellenic+Parliament+Athens" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Parliament</a></li>
              <li><a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Philopappos+Hill+Athens" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Philopappos Hill</a> at sunset</li>
              <li><a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/Areopagus+Hill/@37.9722409,23.7231843,95m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m6!3m5!1s0x14a1bd1972fd320f:0x673dac60a01f1e34!8m2!3d37.9723655!4d23.7232322!16s%2Fg%2F11b66gtt3z!5m1!1e1?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI1MDYxNy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Vrachakia</a> if you&#8217;re feeling adventurous</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="gr-tip gr-tip--tips">
        <div class="gr-tip-title">&#x23F0; Timing Tips</div>
        <ul class="gr-tip-list">
          <li>Book Acropolis tickets in advance at <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://hhticket.gr/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">hhticket.gr</a> (official)</li>
          <li>Go before 9 AM or after 5 PM to beat the heat</li>
          <li>Arrive 30 min before sunset for <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Philopappos+Hill+Athens" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Philopappos</a></li>
          <li><a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Acropolis+Museum+Athens" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Acropolis Museum</a> closed Tuesdays &mdash; check ahead</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

