<!-- MYKONOS -->
<div id="gr-mykonos" class="gr-island">
  <div class="gr-img gr-island-img-wrap" style="aspect-ratio:16/9">
    <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/77/The_windmills_in_Mykonos%2C_Greece_-_50661524068.jpg" alt="Mykonos windmills" loading="lazy">
  </div>
  <div class="gr-island-card">
    <div class="gr-island-card-inner">
      <h2 class="gr-island-name">Mykonos</h2>
      <p class="gr-island-tagline">Glamorous, loud, and unapologetically fun</p>
      <div class="gr-island-body">
        <div class="gr-grid">
          <div class="gr-body">
            <p class="gr-p">Beach clubs, DJs, late nights, and beautiful people. But old town <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Mykonos+Chora" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Chora</a> is genuinely charming, and there&#8217;s a real archaeological gem nearby.</p>
            <h3 class="gr-h3">Beaches</h3>
            <p class="gr-p">Good but below average by Greek island standards. You&#8217;re here for the scene. <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Paradise+Beach+Mykonos" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Paradise</a> and <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Super+Paradise+Beach+Mykonos" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Super Paradise</a> are more party than swim.</p>
            <h3 class="gr-h3">Don&#8217;t Miss</h3>
            <div class="gr-card gr-card--flush">
              <div class="gr-sight gr-sight--ticketed">
                <div class="gr-sight-name">Delos</div>
                <div class="gr-sight-desc">Short boat ride &mdash; one of Greece&#8217;s most important archaeological sites. Birthplace of Apollo and Artemis. Visit with a guide.</div>
                <div class="gr-sight-actions">
                  <a class="gr-sight-action gr-sight-action--map" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Delos+Archaeological+Site" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="gr-sight-action-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#x1F4CD;</span>Map</a>
                  <a class="gr-sight-action gr-sight-action--ticket" href="https://hhticket.gr/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="gr-sight-action-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#x1F39F;&#xFE0F;</span>Official tickets</a>
                </div>
              </div>
              <a class="gr-sight" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Mykonos+Windmills" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                <div class="gr-sight-name">The Windmills <span class="gr-venue-ext">&#x2197;</span></div>
                <div class="gr-sight-desc">Iconic row overlooking the harbor. Classic photo spot, beautiful at sunset.</div>
              </a>
            </div>
            <h3 class="gr-h3">Eat &amp; Drink</h3>
            <div class="gr-venue-list">
              <a class="gr-venue" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Pelican+Restaurant+Mykonos" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                <div class="gr-venue-inner">
                  <span class="gr-venue-icon">&#x1F426;</span>
                  <div>
                    <div class="gr-venue-name">Pelican <span class="gr-venue-ext">&#x2197;</span></div>
                    <div class="gr-venue-desc">Nick&#8217;s top pick for a meal on the island.</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </a>
              <a class="gr-venue" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Caprice+Bar+Mykonos" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                <div class="gr-venue-inner">
                  <span class="gr-venue-icon">&#x1F942;</span>
                  <div>
                    <div class="gr-venue-name">Caprice <span class="gr-venue-ext">&#x2197;</span></div>
                    <div class="gr-venue-desc">Sunset drinks on the water in Little Venice. Stunning views.</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </a>
              <a class="gr-venue" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Skandinavian+Bar+Mykonos" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                <div class="gr-venue-inner">
                  <span class="gr-venue-icon">&#x1F389;</span>
                  <div>
                    <div class="gr-venue-name">Skandinavian <span class="gr-venue-ext">&#x2197;</span></div>
                    <div class="gr-venue-desc">The go-to club for a big night out.</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <aside class="gr-aside">
            <div class="gr-tip gr-tip--essentials">
              <div class="gr-tip-title">&#x1F30A; Essentials</div>
              <ul class="gr-tip-list">
                <li>Stay in old town <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Mykonos+Chora" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Chora</a>, not beach hotels</li>
                <li>Visit <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Delos+Archaeological+Site" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Delos</a> &mdash; don&#8217;t skip it</li>
                <li>Sunset drinks: <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Caprice+Bar+Mykonos" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Caprice</a> in <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Little+Venice+Mykonos" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Little Venice</a></li>
                <li>Big night out: <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Skandinavian+Bar+Mykonos" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Skandinavian</a></li>
                <li>Best meal: <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Pelican+Restaurant+Mykonos" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Pelican</a></li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="gr-tip gr-tip--ferry">
              <div class="gr-tip-title">&#x1F6A2; Getting There</div>
              <ul class="gr-tip-list">
                <li>Ferry from Piraeus: ~2.5&ndash;5 hrs</li>
                <li>Flight: ~45 min from ATH</li>
                <li>Book at <a href="https://ferryscanner.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ferryscanner.com</a></li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- SANTORINI -->
<div id="gr-santorini" class="gr-island">
  <div class="gr-img gr-island-img-wrap" style="aspect-ratio:16/9">
    <img src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/07-17-2012_-_Oia_-_Santorini_-_Greece_-_19.jpg?width=900" alt="Oia blue domes at sunset, Santorini" loading="lazy">
  </div>
  <div class="gr-island-card">
    <div class="gr-island-card-inner">
      <h2 class="gr-island-name">Santorini</h2>
      <p class="gr-island-tagline">Dramatic cliffs, legendary sunsets, real depth</p>
      <div class="gr-island-body">
        <div class="gr-grid">
          <div class="gr-body">
            <p class="gr-p">Built on a volcanic caldera &mdash; cliffs into deep blue water, white buildings stacked together. Romantic, photogenic, historically rich.</p>
            <h3 class="gr-h3">Where to Stay</h3>
            <p class="gr-p"><a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Fira+Santorini" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>Fira</strong></a> is lively. <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Oia+Santorini" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>Oia</strong></a> is fancier with the iconic sunset. Stay along the caldera coast between them for a middle ground.</p>
            <h3 class="gr-h3">Things to Do</h3>
            <div class="gr-img" style="aspect-ratio:16/7;margin-bottom:12px">
              <img src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Hiking_Santorini_(7449565644).jpg?width=900" alt="Fira to Oia caldera hike" loading="lazy">
            </div>
            <div class="gr-card gr-card--flush">
              <a class="gr-sight" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Castle+of+Oia+Agios+Nikolaos+Santorini" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                <div class="gr-sight-name">Oia Castle (Agios Nikolaos) <span class="gr-venue-ext">&#x2197;</span></div>
                <div class="gr-sight-desc">15th-century Venetian fortress ruins. The sunset spot &mdash; arrive early.</div>
              </a>
              <a class="gr-sight" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Fira+to+Oia+Hike+Santorini" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                <div class="gr-sight-name">Fira to Oia Hike <span class="gr-venue-ext">&#x2197;</span></div>
                <div class="gr-sight-desc">~10 km caldera rim trail. Very little shade &mdash; go early, bring water.</div>
              </a>
              <div class="gr-sight gr-sight--ticketed">
                <div class="gr-sight-name">Akrotiri</div>
                <div class="gr-sight-desc">Bronze Age settlement &mdash; the &#8220;Pompeii of the Aegean.&#8221; Over 3,500 years old.</div>
                <div class="gr-sight-actions">
                  <a class="gr-sight-action gr-sight-action--map" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Akrotiri+Archaeological+Site+Santorini" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="gr-sight-action-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#x1F4CD;</span>Map</a>
                  <a class="gr-sight-action gr-sight-action--ticket" href="https://hhticket.gr/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="gr-sight-action-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#x1F39F;&#xFE0F;</span>Official tickets</a>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="gr-sight gr-sight--ticketed">
                <div class="gr-sight-name">Ancient Thira</div>
                <div class="gr-sight-desc">Hellenistic ruins on a ridge between Kamari and Perissa beaches.</div>
                <div class="gr-sight-actions">
                  <a class="gr-sight-action gr-sight-action--map" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Ancient+Thera+Santorini" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="gr-sight-action-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#x1F4CD;</span>Map</a>
                  <a class="gr-sight-action gr-sight-action--ticket" href="https://hhticket.gr/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="gr-sight-action-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#x1F39F;&#xFE0F;</span>Official tickets</a>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="gr-sight gr-sight--grouped">
                <div class="gr-sight-name">Museums in Fira</div>
                <div class="gr-sight-desc">Good indoor stop before or after Akrotiri.</div>
                <div class="gr-sight-links">
                  <a class="gr-sight-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Fira+Santorini" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Fira <span class="gr-venue-ext">&#x2197;</span></a>
                  <a class="gr-sight-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Museum+of+Prehistoric+Thera+Fira" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Museum of Prehistoric Thera <span class="gr-venue-ext">&#x2197;</span></a>
                  <a class="gr-sight-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Archaeological+Museum+of+Thera+Fira" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Archaeological Museum of Thera <span class="gr-venue-ext">&#x2197;</span></a>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="gr-sight gr-sight--grouped">
                <div class="gr-sight-name">Red &amp; White Beach</div>
                <div class="gr-sight-desc">Dramatic colored cliffs. Red Beach on foot, White Beach by boat.</div>
                <div class="gr-sight-links">
                  <a class="gr-sight-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Red+Beach+Santorini" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Red Beach <span class="gr-venue-ext">&#x2197;</span></a>
                  <a class="gr-sight-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=White+Beach+Santorini" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">White Beach <span class="gr-venue-ext">&#x2197;</span></a>
                </div>
              </div>
              <a class="gr-sight" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Ammoudi+Bay+Santorini" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                <div class="gr-sight-name">Ammoudi Bay <span class="gr-venue-ext">&#x2197;</span></div>
                <div class="gr-sight-desc">Hidden harbor below Oia. Hike or donkey down for swimming and seafood.</div>
              </a>
            </div>
            <h3 class="gr-h3">Eat &amp; Drink</h3>
            <div class="gr-venue-list">
              <a class="gr-venue" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Yogi+Gyro+Santorini" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                <div class="gr-venue-inner">
                  <span class="gr-venue-icon">&#x1F959;</span>
                  <div>
                    <div class="gr-venue-name">Yogi Gyro <span class="gr-venue-ext">&#x2197;</span></div>
                    <div class="gr-venue-desc">In Fira &mdash; best gyros on the island.</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </a>
              <a class="gr-venue" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=PK+Cocktail+Bar+Santorini" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                <div class="gr-venue-inner">
                  <span class="gr-venue-icon">&#x1F305;</span>
                  <div>
                    <div class="gr-venue-name">PK Cocktail Bar <span class="gr-venue-ext">&#x2197;</span></div>
                    <div class="gr-venue-desc">The spot for sunset drinks.</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <aside class="gr-aside">
            <div class="gr-tip gr-tip--essentials">
              <div class="gr-tip-title">&#x1F305; Essentials</div>
              <ul class="gr-tip-list">
                <li>Stay in <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Oia+Santorini" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Oia</a> for iconic sunset views</li>
                <li>Book caldera-view hotels early</li>
                <li>Hike <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Fira+to+Oia+Hike+Santorini" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Fira &rarr; Oia</a> (10 km, go early)</li>
                <li>Visit <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Akrotiri+Archaeological+Site+Santorini" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Akrotiri</a> archaeological site</li>
                <li>Sunset drinks: <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=PK+Cocktail+Bar+Santorini" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">PK Cocktail Bar</a></li>
                <li>Best gyros: <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Yogi+Gyro+Santorini" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Yogi Gyro</a> in <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Fira+Santorini" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Fira</a></li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="gr-tip gr-tip--ferry">
              <div class="gr-tip-title">&#x1F6A2; Getting There</div>
              <ul class="gr-tip-list">
                <li>Ferry from Piraeus: ~8 hrs (overnight)</li>
                <li>High-speed ferry: ~5 hrs</li>
                <li>Flight: ~45 min from ATH</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- CRETE -->
<div id="gr-crete" class="gr-island">
  <div class="gr-img gr-island-img-wrap" style="aspect-ratio:16/9">
    <img src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Chania_-_Venetian_harbor_1.jpg?width=900" alt="Chania Venetian harbor, Crete" loading="lazy">
  </div>
  <div class="gr-island-card">
    <div class="gr-island-card-inner">
      <h2 class="gr-island-name">Crete</h2>
      <p class="gr-island-tagline">The largest island &mdash; feels like its own country</p>
      <div class="gr-island-body">
        <div class="gr-grid">
          <div class="gr-body">
            <p class="gr-p">Gorges, beaches, Venetian harbors, ancient palaces, incredible food. Plan at least a full week.</p>
            <h3 class="gr-h3">Getting There</h3>
            <div class="gr-chips">
              <a class="gr-chip" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Chania+Crete" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">&#x2708;&#xFE0F; Chania (CHQ)</a>
              <a class="gr-chip" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Heraklion+Crete" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">&#x2708;&#xFE0F; Heraklion (HER)</a>
              <span class="gr-chip">&#x26F4; Overnight ferry</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="gr-h3">Where to Stay</h3>
            <p class="gr-p"><a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Chania+Crete" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>Chania</strong></a> (west) &mdash; Lively Venetian harbor town, best base for the gorge and beaches. Try <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Riviera+Suites+Chania" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>Riviera Suites</strong></a>. <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Elounda+Crete" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>Elounda</strong></a> (northeast) &mdash; Quieter, upscale, closer to Knossos and Spinalonga. These are opposite ends of the island &mdash; pick one based on your itinerary.</p>
            <h3 class="gr-h3">Things to Do</h3>
            <div class="gr-img" style="aspect-ratio:16/7;margin-bottom:12px">
              <img src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Samaria_Gorge_05.jpg?width=900" alt="Samaria Gorge" loading="lazy">
            </div>
            <div class="gr-card gr-card--flush">
              <a class="gr-sight" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Samaria+Gorge+Crete" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                <div class="gr-sight-name">Samari&aacute; Gorge <span class="gr-venue-ext">&#x2197;</span></div>
                <div class="gr-sight-desc">~16 km, one of Europe&#8217;s longest. Full day. Book a tour bus from Chania.</div>
              </a>
              <a class="gr-sight" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Elafonisi+Beach+Crete" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                <div class="gr-sight-name">Elafonisi Beach <span class="gr-venue-ext">&#x2197;</span></div>
                <div class="gr-sight-desc">Pink-sand lagoon. Almost tropical. Dedicate a full day.</div>
              </a>
              <div class="gr-sight gr-sight--ticketed">
                <div class="gr-sight-name">Palace of Knossos</div>
                <div class="gr-sight-desc">Center of Minoan civilization, home of the labyrinth. Get a guide.</div>
                <div class="gr-sight-actions">
                  <a class="gr-sight-action gr-sight-action--map" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Palace+of+Knossos+Crete" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="gr-sight-action-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#x1F4CD;</span>Map</a>
                  <a class="gr-sight-action gr-sight-action--ticket" href="https://hhticket.gr/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="gr-sight-action-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#x1F39F;&#xFE0F;</span>Official tickets</a>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="gr-sight gr-sight--ticketed">
                <div class="gr-sight-name">Heraklion Archaeological Museum</div>
                <div class="gr-sight-desc">Finest Minoan collection in the world.</div>
                <div class="gr-sight-actions">
                  <a class="gr-sight-action gr-sight-action--map" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Heraklion+Archaeological+Museum" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="gr-sight-action-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#x1F4CD;</span>Map</a>
                  <a class="gr-sight-action gr-sight-action--ticket" href="https://hhticket.gr/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="gr-sight-action-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#x1F39F;&#xFE0F;</span>Official tickets</a>
                </div>
              </div>
              <a class="gr-sight" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Fortezza+of+Rethymno" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                <div class="gr-sight-name">Fortezza (Rethymno) <span class="gr-venue-ext">&#x2197;</span></div>
                <div class="gr-sight-desc">Venetian fortress. Stop for a visit and lunch between Heraklion and Chania.</div>
              </a>
              <a class="gr-sight" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Firka+Fortress+Chania" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                <div class="gr-sight-name">Firka Fortress (Chania) <span class="gr-venue-ext">&#x2197;</span></div>
                <div class="gr-sight-desc">At Chania&#8217;s old harbor entrance. Great views.</div>
              </a>
              <a class="gr-sight" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Spinalonga+Crete" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                <div class="gr-sight-name">Spinalonga <span class="gr-venue-ext">&#x2197;</span></div>
                <div class="gr-sight-desc">Fortified island near Elounda. Short boat trip to explore.</div>
              </a>
            </div>
            <h3 class="gr-h3">Eat &amp; Drink</h3>
            <div class="gr-venue-list">
              <a class="gr-venue" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Red+Jane+Bakery+Chania" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                <div class="gr-venue-inner">
                  <span class="gr-venue-icon">&#x1F950;</span>
                  <div>
                    <div class="gr-venue-name">Red Jane Bakery <span class="gr-venue-ext">&#x2197;</span></div>
                    <div class="gr-venue-desc">In Chania &mdash; don&#8217;t skip it.</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </a>
              <a class="gr-venue" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Sinagogi+bar+Chania" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                <div class="gr-venue-inner">
                  <span class="gr-venue-icon">&#x1F378;</span>
                  <div>
                    <div class="gr-venue-name">Sinagogi <span class="gr-venue-ext">&#x2197;</span></div>
                    <div class="gr-venue-desc">Best bar in Chania.</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </a>
            </div>
            <div class="gr-note">
              <p>We&#8217;ve barely scratched the surface. Do your own research &mdash; or better yet, ask a local.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <aside class="gr-aside">
            <div class="gr-tip gr-tip--essentials">
              <div class="gr-tip-title">&#x1F3D4; Essentials</div>
              <ul class="gr-tip-list">
                <li>Plan at least a full week</li>
                <li>Base in <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Chania+Crete" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Chania</a> &mdash; try <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Riviera+Suites+Chania" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Riviera Suites</a></li>
                <li>Book <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Samaria+Gorge+Crete" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Samari&aacute; Gorge</a> tour the day before</li>
                <li>Red Jane Bakery &mdash; don&#8217;t skip it</li>
                <li>Best bar in <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Chania+Crete" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Chania</a>: <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Sinagogi+bar+Chania" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Sinagogi</a></li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="gr-tip gr-tip--ferry">
              <div class="gr-tip-title">&#x1F6A2; Getting There</div>
              <ul class="gr-tip-list">
                <li>Fly to <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Chania+Crete" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Chania</a> (CHQ) or <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Heraklion+Crete" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Heraklion</a> (HER)</li>
                <li>Overnight ferry from Piraeus &mdash; get a cabin</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="gr-tip gr-tip--logistics">
              <div class="gr-tip-title">&#x1F5FA; Logistics</div>
              <dl class="gr-fact-list">
                <div><dt>Car hire</dt><dd>essential to explore</dd></div>
                <div><dt><a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Chania+Crete" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Chania</a> &harr; <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Heraklion+Crete" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Heraklion</a></dt><dd>2.5 hrs by car</dd></div>
                <div><dt><a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Elounda+Crete" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Elounda</a></dt><dd>1.5 hrs from Heraklion</dd></div>
              </dl>
            </div>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- PAROS & NAXOS -->
<div id="gr-paros-naxos" class="gr-island">
  <div class="gr-img gr-island-img-wrap" style="aspect-ratio:16/9">
    <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/69/The_Portara_of_Naxos_at_Sunset.jpg" alt="Portara, Temple of Apollo, Naxos" loading="lazy">
  </div>
  <div class="gr-island-card">
    <div class="gr-island-card-inner">
      <h2 class="gr-island-name">Paros &amp; Naxos</h2>
      <p class="gr-island-tagline">Close neighbors, easy to visit together</p>
      <div class="gr-island-body">
        <div class="gr-grid">
          <div class="gr-body">
            <p class="gr-p">Ferries between them take 30&ndash;45 minutes. Either is great on its own.</p>
            <h3 class="gr-h3">Naxos</h3>
            <p class="gr-p">The most well-rounded island &mdash; beaches, history, mountain villages, great food, youthful energy.</p>
            <div class="gr-card gr-card--flush">
              <div class="gr-sight">
                <div class="gr-sight-name">Guided bus tour</div>
                <div class="gr-sight-desc">Hit the island&#8217;s major sights with a local guide.</div>
              </div>
              <div class="gr-sight">
                <div class="gr-sight-name">Catamaran cruise</div>
                <div class="gr-sight-desc">Swimming in secluded coves with lunch on board.</div>
              </div>
              <a class="gr-sight" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Portara+Temple+of+Apollo+Naxos" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                <div class="gr-sight-name">Portara (Temple of Apollo) <span class="gr-venue-ext">&#x2197;</span></div>
                <div class="gr-sight-desc">Iconic marble gateway. Beautiful at sunset.</div>
              </a>
            </div>
            <h3 class="gr-h3">Paros &amp; Antiparos</h3>
            <p class="gr-p">Paros has charming <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Parikia+Paros" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Parikia</a> and pretty <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Naoussa+Paros" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Naoussa</a>. <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Antiparos" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Antiparos</a> has a great secluded cliff beach hike. Ask around when you arrive.</p>
          </div>
          <aside class="gr-aside">
            <div class="gr-tip gr-tip--essentials">
              <div class="gr-tip-title">&#x2728; Naxos Essentials</div>
              <ul class="gr-tip-list">
                <li>Best all-around Cycladic island</li>
                <li>Book a guided bus tour</li>
                <li>Catamaran cruise: coves &amp; lunch on board</li>
                <li><a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Portara+Temple+of+Apollo+Naxos" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Portara</a> at sunset &mdash; unmissable</li>
                <li>Paros: <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Parikia+Paros" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Parikia</a> &amp; <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Naoussa+Paros" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Naoussa</a> village</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="gr-tip gr-tip--ferry">
              <div class="gr-tip-title">&#x1F6A2; Getting There</div>
              <ul class="gr-tip-list">
                <li>Ferry from Piraeus: ~5 hrs to Naxos</li>
                <li>Paros &harr; Naxos: 30&ndash;45 min</li>
                <li>Book at <a href="https://ferryscanner.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ferryscanner.com</a></li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- OTHER ISLANDS -->
<section id="gr-other-islands" class="gr-section">
  <h2 class="gr-h2">Other Islands Worth Knowing</h2>
  <div class="gr-other-list">
    <div class="gr-other-card">
      <div class="gr-img" style="aspect-ratio:16/7">
        <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/24/Milos_Sarakiniko.JPG" alt="Sarakiniko Beach, Milos" loading="lazy">
      </div>
      <div class="gr-other-card-body">
        <h3 class="gr-other-name">Milos</h3>
        <p class="gr-other-desc">Volcanic coastline, sea caves, colorful beaches. <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Sarakiniko+Beach+Milos" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Sarakiniko</a>&#8217;s white lunar landscape is iconic. Quieter, rugged &mdash; great for couples.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="gr-other-card">
      <div class="gr-img" style="aspect-ratio:16/7">
        <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6e/Rhodes_old_town_Greece_6.jpg" alt="Rhodes Old Town" loading="lazy">
      </div>
      <div class="gr-other-card-body">
        <h3 class="gr-other-name">Rhodes</h3>
        <p class="gr-other-desc"><a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Rhodes+Old+Town" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Medieval Old Town</a> is a UNESCO site &mdash; a walled city for hours. Beaches, <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Lindos+Acropolis+Rhodes" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ancient Lindos</a>, different vibe from the Cyclades.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="gr-other-card">
      <div class="gr-img" style="aspect-ratio:16/7">
        <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4e/The_Old_Town_of_Corfu.jpg" alt="Corfu Old Town" loading="lazy">
      </div>
      <div class="gr-other-card-body">
        <h3 class="gr-other-name">Corfu</h3>
        <p class="gr-other-desc">Northwest, closer to Italy. Venetian influence, lush green hills, elegant architecture around <a class="gr-inline-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Corfu+Old+Town" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Corfu Old Town</a>. Longer journey but completely different.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

